Summary of changes:

1. `src/tools.rs` — build_sub_agent_tool now returns (SubAgentTool, SharedState) instead of just SubAgentTool. It creates a SharedState::new(), passes it to the SubAgentTool via .with_shared_state(shared_state.clone()), and returns both. The sub-agent automatically gets a shared_state tool (yoagent's SharedStateTool) to read/write the shared store.

2. `src/main.rs` — Added "shared_state" to BUILTIN_TOOL_NAMES so the MCP collision guard knows about it. Updated the single call site to destructure the tuple: `let (sub_agent_tool, _shared_state) = build_sub_agent_tool(self)`.

3. 4 new tests:
   • builtin_tool_names_includes_shared_state — guards the MCP collision list
   • test_build_sub_agent_tool_returns_shared_state — fresh state has no keys
   • test_shared_state_parent_can_prepopulate — parent writes, reads back
   • test_shared_state_independent_per_build — each build gets isolated state

4. Docs updated in CLAUDE.md (architecture, MCP gotchas, yoagent features) and `docs/src/configuration/skills.md` (tool collision list).

